omaly_failure.4156":{"zh":"避难所坍塌","en":"The vault collapses"},"anomaly_failure.4157":{"zh":"容器：作物样本","en":"Container: crop samples"},"anomaly_failure.4158":{"zh":"容器：生物武器","en":"Container: bio-weapon"}}},"chapters":[{"id":"anomalies:NUKE_PLANET_CAT","kind":"anomaly","title":{"zh":"末日之冬","en":"The Winter of the Fallen"},"texts":[{"zh":"这片核废土是这里逝去文明的佐证。我们应该进一步调查那些探测器探测到的有活动迹象的地点。","en":"The nuclear wasteland is evidently a sign of a previous civilization. Our scanners are picking up activity at certain locations that we should investigate."}],"sections":[{"zh":"这片核废土是这里逝去文明的佐证。我们应该进一步调查那些探测器探测到的有活动迹象的地点。","en":"The nuclear wasteland is evidently a sign of a previous civilization. Our scanners are picking up activity at certain locations that we should investigate."}],"image":"art/1847c49a9205c90405fe.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"anomaly.4155","kind":"research","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"research","source":"common/anomalies/02_anomaly_categories.txt:478","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-nuke-planet-cat"}],"source":{"file":"common/anomalies/02_anomaly_categories.txt","line":456}},{"id":"anomaly.4155","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"战场之下","en":"Beneath the Battlefield"},"texts":[{"zh":"[From.GetName]曾经拥有一个高等文明。但他们早已成为历史尘埃。异形猛兽在星球表面的远古战场上肆虐横行。\n\n在石山地区的山脉底部藏有一个避难所。如果我们能先处理掉地表的猛兽，我们就可以继续调查。","en":"[From.GetName] used to hold an advanced civilization. It is now dead silent. Alien beasts roam old battlefields that stretch across the surface.\n\nIn a rocky region there seems to lie a hidden vault beneath the mountains. If we could get rid of the beasts roaming the landscape we could investigate it."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/a0e295ed3c881e8c227f.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"anomaly.4155.a","label":{"zh":"马上动手尝试！","en":"Let's try and get to it!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"special_projects:CRYOPOD_FOUND_PROJECT","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/anomaly_events_3.txt:4291","story":"anomaly-nuke-planet-cat"}],"terminal":false,"sets":["cryo_pod_planet"]},{"key":"anomaly.4155.b","label":{"zh":"远离避难所和在那里游荡的灵魂。","en":"Leave the vault, and its wandering spirits be."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_spiritualist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"唯心主义","en":"Spiritualist"}}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/anomaly_events_3.txt","line":4277},"names":{"From.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet","note":{"zh":"游戏里这里会出现这颗星球的名称。","en":"In the game, the planet's name appears here."}}}},{"id":"special_projects:CRYOPOD_FOUND_PROJECT","kind":"project","title":{"zh":"地下避难所","en":"Underground Vault"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们在山体底下找到了一个可能包含宝贵信息或者装置的建筑物。它的周围有危险的野生动物，为了得到它我们需要制服这些野兽。","en":"We found a structure beneath a mountain which could contain valuable information or gear. It is surrounded by dangerous wildlife and we need to subdue these beasts in order to get to it."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/a0e295ed3c881e8c227f.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"anomaly.4156","kind":"random","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"random","chance":0.7,"group":"r1","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_3.txt:499","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-nuke-planet-cat"},{"target":"anomaly_failure.4156","kind":"random","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"random","chance":0.3,"group":"r1","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_3.txt:500","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-nuke-planet-cat"}],"source":{"file":"common/special_projects/00_projects_3.txt","line":478}},{"id":"anomaly.4156","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"战场之下","en":"Beneath the Battlefield"},"texts":[{"zh":"清除猛兽后，我们进入了避难所。内部似乎是一间指挥室，为这个死亡文明的领袖们提供最后的庇护。\n\n避难所内全是破损的设备和腐烂的尸体。唯一值得调查的是一个容器，可能装有十分重要的东西。","en":"With the beasts removed, we could access the vault. Inside it lay a headquarter of sorts, a last refuge for a dying world's leaders.\n\nThe vault is filled with destroyed equipment and decomposed corpses. The only thing of interest being a container, which potentially holds something of importance."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/114a28677a447f6d61c7.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"RESEARCHIT","label":{"zh":"带回母星研究！","en":"Send it to our homeworld for research."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"special_projects:CRYOPOD_OPENING_PROJECT","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/anomaly_events_3.txt:4344","story":"anomaly-nuke-planet-cat"}],"terminal":false},{"key":"anomaly.4156.b","label":{"zh":"以防万一，只研究避难所。","en":"Only study the vault to avoid risks."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/anomaly_events_3.txt","line":4319}},{"id":"special_projects:CRYOPOD_OPENING_PROJECT","kind":"project","title":{"zh":"撬开它","en":"Cracking it Open"},"texts":[{"zh":"我们发现的避难所中存放着一个容器。如果我们想知道里面有什么，我们需要找到撬开它的最佳方法。","en":"The underground vault we found held only a container of sorts. We need to figure out how to best pry it open if we want to find out what is inside."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/c6521a2bac2bb7c2248c.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"anomaly.4157","kind":"random","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"random","chance":0.4,"group":"r2","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_3.txt:523","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-nuke-planet-cat"},{"target":"anomaly_failure.4157","kind":"random","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"random","chance":0.3,"group":"r2","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_3.txt:524","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-nuke-planet-cat"},{"target":"anomaly_failure.4158","kind":"random","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"random","chance":0.3,"group":"r2","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_3.txt:525","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-nuke-planet-cat"}],"source":{"file":"common/special_projects/00_projects_3.txt","line":506}},{"id":"anomaly.4157","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"冷冻舱中的勇士","en":"Cryopod Warrior"},"texts":[{"zh":"在[WarriorHomePlanet.GetName]上发现的容器原来是一个冷藏装置！封存的外星人已经苏醒。她用心灵感应说道：\n\n“为什么叫醒我？我们一族的战争结束了吗？”","en":"The container found on [WarriorHomePlanet.GetName] turned out to be a cryogenic device! The preserved alien within has awoken. She speaks using telepathic concepts:\n\n\"Why have you brought me back, captor? Is the war of my people over?\""}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"anomaly.4157.a","label":{"zh":"你目前在[HomePlanet.GetName]上。这里很安全。","en":"You are on [HomePlanet.GetName]. You are safe here."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"anomaly.4158","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/anomaly_events_3.txt:4414","story":"anomaly-nuke-planet-cat"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophile","value":true,"label":{"zh":"亲外主义","en":"Xenophile"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_fanatic_materialist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"极端唯物主义","en":"Fanatic Materialist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_militarist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"军国主义","en":"Militarist"}}],[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_fanatic_spiritualist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"极端唯心主义","en":"Fanatic Spiritualist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_fanatic_materialist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"极端唯物主义","en":"Fanatic Materialist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_militarist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"军国主义","en":"Militarist"}}],[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_pacifist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"和平主义","en":"Pacifist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_fanatic_materialist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"极端唯物主义","en":"Fanatic Materialist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_militarist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"军国主义","en":"Militarist"}}]],"sets":["suspected_angels"]},{"key":"anomaly.4157.b","label":{"zh":"你的家乡被战争毁灭了，只有你幸存。","en":"Your home planet was ruined by the war, only you remain."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"anomaly.4158","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/anomaly_events_3.txt:4430","story":"anomaly-nuke-planet-cat"}],"terminal":false},{"key":"anomaly.4157.c","label":{"zh":"我们尽力从你们被毁的家园抢救物资。","en":"We salvaged what we could of your ruined homeworld."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"anomaly.4159","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/anomaly_events_3.txt:4436","story":"anomaly-nuke-planet-cat"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":true,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_fanatic_spiritualist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"极端唯心主义","en":"Fanatic Spiritualist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_pacifist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"和平主义","en":"Pacifist"}}],[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_militarist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"军国主义","en":"Militarist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_fanatic_spiritualist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"极端唯心主义","en":"Fanatic Spiritualist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_pacifist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"和平主义","en":"Pacifist"}}],[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_fanatic_egalitarian","value":true,"label":{"zh":"极端平等主义","en":"Fanatic Egalitarian"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_fanatic_spiritualist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"极端唯心主义","en":"Fanatic Spiritualist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_pacifist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"和平主义","en":"Pacifist"}}],[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_fanatic_materialist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"极端唯物主义","en":"Fanatic Materialist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_fanatic_spiritualist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"极端唯心主义","en":"Fanatic Spiritualist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_pacifist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"和平主义","en":"Pacifist"}}]],"sets":["suspected_assholes"]}],"next":[{"target":"story.5","kind":"delay","conditional":false,"delayed":true,"sourceKind":"delay","delay":[{"days":"30"}],"source":"events/anomaly_events_3.txt:4376","hooks":["immediate"],"story":"origin_fear_of_the_dark"}],"source":{"file":"events/anomaly_events_3.txt","line":4365},"names":{"HomePlanet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet","note":{"zh":"游戏里这里会出现这颗星球的名称。","en":"In the game, the planet's name appears here."}},"WarriorHomePlanet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet","note":{"zh":"游戏里这里会出现这颗星球的名称。","en":"In the game, the planet's name appears here."}}}},{"id":"anomaly.4158","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"冷冻舱中的勇士","en":"Cryopod Warrior"},"texts":[{"zh":"“我就怕这种事发生。希望我的知识和我们种群的悲剧能带给别人教诲。”","en":"\"I feared that this would happen. I only hope that my knowledge, and our failure as a species, can teach others.\""}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"anomaly.4158.a","label":{"zh":"和我们说说你自己。","en":"Tell us about yourself."},"responses":[{"zh":"“我叫玛居拉，拥有‘领受者’的称号。我是一名将军，是东方女王的顾问，也是她忠诚的朋友。”","en":"\"I am Majula, the one bearing the title of \"The Bearer.\" I was a general, advisor to the Queen of the East, and her loyal friend.\""}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false},{"key":"anomaly.4158.b","label":{"zh":"为什么你被冷藏了？","en":"Why were you preserved?"},"responses":[{"zh":"“我拥有‘领受者’的称号。如果我们走向了灭亡，我要负责代表我的人民。除了对自己物种的了解，我在战争方面的知识最为丰富。”","en":"\"I bore the title of \"The Bearer.\" I was responsible of representing our people, would we end up walking the path of extinction. My knowledge of war was only outranked by my knowledge of our people.\""}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_spiritualist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"唯心主义","en":"Spiritualist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_militarist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"军国主义","en":"Militarist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":false,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}}]]},{"key":"anomaly.4158.militant.b","label":{"zh":"在战时被冷冻，你一定是个重要人物？","en":"To be frozen in war you must be of high value?"},"responses":[{"zh":"“我拥有‘领受者’的称号。如果我们走向了灭亡，我要负责代表我的人民。除了对自己物种的了解，我在战争方面的知识最为丰富。”","en":"\"I bore the title of \"The Bearer.\" I was responsible of representing our people, would we end up walking the path of extinction. My knowledge of war was only outranked by my knowledge of our people.\""}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_militarist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"军国主义","en":"Militarist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_spiritualist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"唯心主义","en":"Spiritualist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":false,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}}]]},{"key":"anomaly.4158.spiritual.b","label":{"zh":"你是出于什么神圣的任务而被冷藏的吗？","en":"Were you preserved for a divine mission?"},"responses":[{"zh":"“我拥有‘领受者’的称号。如果我们走向了灭亡，我要负责代表我的人民。除了对自己物种的了解，我在战争方面的知识最为丰富。”","en":"\"I bore the title of \"The Bearer.\" I was responsible of representing our people, would we end up walking the path of extinction. My knowledge of war was only outranked by my knowledge of our people.\""}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_spiritualist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"唯心主义","en":"Spiritualist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_militarist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"军国主义","en":"Militarist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":false,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}}]]},{"key":"anomaly.4158.c","label":{"zh":"说说你的人民。","en":"Tell us about your people."},"responses":[{"zh":"“惹是生非的种群。我们的历史中……走向毁灭之路的故事比比皆是。人们不懂得实现自身价值。虽然存在许多明智之人，但很少有人愿意倾听。”","en":"\"A troubled kind. Our history is... was filled with stories of our inability to steer clear from the road to destruction. The group was unable to live