,"en":"Pacifist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophile","value":false,"label":{"zh":"亲外主义","en":"Xenophile"}}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/anomaly_events_3.txt","line":4785},"names":{"WarriorHomePlanet.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet","note":{"zh":"游戏里这里会出现这颗星球的名称。","en":"In the game, the planet's name appears here."}}}},{"id":"anomaly.4160","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"冷冻舱中的勇士","en":"Cryopod Warrior"},"texts":[{"zh":"“你的话语和你的文明向我证明了一切，捕获者。我会加入你，希望你能吸取我们种群的教训。”","en":"\"Your words, and your civilization speaks to me, captor. I will join you, in hopes that you will learn from my people's mistakes."}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"EXCELLENT","label":{"zh":"棒极了。","en":"Excellent."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/anomaly_events_3.txt","line":4741}},{"id":"anomaly.4162","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"冷冻舱中的勇士","en":"Cryopod Warrior"},"texts":[{"zh":"“宁死不屈！”\n\n玛居拉愤怒地冲出房间。外面的人群正准备进行阻拦，她就抓住了一名研究员作为人质。在逃离过程中，人质不幸牺牲而玛居拉也被警卫击毙。","en":"\"I would rather die!\"\n\nMajula runs out of the room, enraged. As a crowd had gathered outside to take part in the proceedings she grabs a researcher to use as leverage. In the escape, the researcher dies before Majula is gunned down by security."}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"CURSES","label":{"zh":"可恶！","en":"Curses!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/anomaly_events_3.txt","line":4828}},{"id":"anomaly.4163","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"冷冻舱中的勇士","en":"Cryopod Warrior"},"texts":[{"zh":"“再见了，捕获者。试着吸取我们物种的教训，千万不要在我们下一次相遇时，你也成了你们物种的最后一人。”","en":"\"Farewell, captor. Try and learn from what happened to my people, lest we meet again and you too have ended up to be the last of your kind.\""}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"anomaly.4163.a","label":{"zh":"永别了。","en":"Farewell."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":false,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}}]]},{"key":"anomaly.4163.b","label":{"zh":"出去！","en":"Get out!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":true,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/anomaly_events_3.txt","line":4873}},{"id":"anomaly.4159","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"冷冻舱中的勇士","en":"Cryopod Warrior"},"texts":[{"zh":"“是这样吗……我就怕醒来时会得到这个消息。说实话，我更怕永远醒不过来。你们一族想从我这里获得什么？”","en":"\"So that's why... I feared that I would wake up to these news. To be honest I feared I would never wake at all. What does your kind want of me?\""}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"anomaly.4158.a","label":{"zh":"和我们说说你自己。","en":"Tell us about yourself."},"responses":[{"zh":"“我叫玛居拉，拥有‘领受者’的称号。我是一名将军，是东方女王的顾问，也是她忠诚的朋友。”","en":"\"I am Majula, the one bearing the title of \"The Bearer.\" I was a general, advisor to the Queen of the East, and her loyal friend.\""}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false},{"key":"anomaly.4158.b","label":{"zh":"为什么你被冷藏了？","en":"Why were you preserved?"},"responses":[{"zh":"“我拥有‘领受者’的称号。如果我们走向了灭亡，我要负责代表我的人民。除了对自己物种的了解，我在战争方面的知识最为丰富。”","en":"\"I bore the title of \"The Bearer.\" I was responsible of representing our people, would we end up walking the path of extinction. My knowledge of war was only outranked by my knowledge of our people.\""}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_spiritualist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"唯心主义","en":"Spiritualist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_militarist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"军国主义","en":"Militarist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":false,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}}]]},{"key":"anomaly.4158.militant.b","label":{"zh":"在战时被冷冻，你一定是个重要人物？","en":"To be frozen in war you must be of high value?"},"responses":[{"zh":"“我拥有‘领受者’的称号。如果我们走向了灭亡，我要负责代表我的人民。除了对自己物种的了解，我在战争方面的知识最为丰富。”","en":"\"I bore the title of \"The Bearer.\" I was responsible of representing our people, would we end up walking the path of extinction. My knowledge of war was only outranked by my knowledge of our people.\""}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_militarist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"军国主义","en":"Militarist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_spiritualist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"唯心主义","en":"Spiritualist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":false,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}}]]},{"key":"anomaly.4158.spiritual.b","label":{"zh":"你是出于什么神圣的任务而被冷藏的吗？","en":"Were you preserved for a divine mission?"},"responses":[{"zh":"“我拥有‘领受者’的称号。如果我们走向了灭亡，我要负责代表我的人民。除了对自己物种的了解，我在战争方面的知识最为丰富。”","en":"\"I bore the title of \"The Bearer.\" I was responsible of representing our people, would we end up walking the path of extinction. My knowledge of war was only outranked by my knowledge of our people.\""}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_spiritualist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"唯心主义","en":"Spiritualist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_militarist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"军国主义","en":"Militarist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":false,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}}]]},{"key":"anomaly.4158.c","label":{"zh":"说说你的人民。","en":"Tell us about your people."},"responses":[{"zh":"“惹是生非的种群。我们的历史中……走向毁灭之路的故事比比皆是。人们不懂得实现自身价值。虽然存在许多明智之人，但很少有人愿意倾听。”","en":"\"A troubled kind. Our history is... was filled with stories of our inability to steer clear from the road to destruction. The group was unable to live up to the potential of the individual. We had many wise speakers, but few who chose to listen.\""}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":false,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}}]]},{"key":"anomaly.4158.d","label":{"zh":"你会加入我们吗？","en":"Will you join us?"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"anomaly.4161","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/anomaly_events_3.txt:4675","story":"anomaly-nuke-planet-cat"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_spiritualist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"唯心主义","en":"Spiritualist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_pacifist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"和平主义","en":"Pacifist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_fanatic_militarist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"极端军国主义","en":"Fanatic Militarist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_fanatic_materialist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"极端唯物主义","en":"Fanatic Materialist"}}]]},{"key":"anomaly.4158.d","label":{"zh":"你会加入我们吗？","en":"Will you join us?"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"anomaly.4160","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/anomaly_events_3.txt:4697","story":"anomaly-nuke-planet-cat"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"suspected_angels","path":"","value":true},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_spiritualist","value":true,"label":{"zh":"唯心主义","en":"Spiritualist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_fanatic_militarist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"极端军国主义","en":"Fanatic Militarist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_fanatic_materialist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"极端唯物主义","en":"Fanatic Materialist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_fanatic_pacifist","value":false,"label":{"zh":"极端和平主义","en":"Fanatic Pacifist"}},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_xenophobe","value":false,"label":{"zh":"排外主义","en":"Xenophobe"}}],[{"type":"flag","scope":"country","name":"suspected_angels","path":"","value":true},{"type":"identity","key":"ethic_pacifist","v